  "full_response": "**Meeting Notes - Project Alpha Meeting**\n\n**Date:** October 5, 2023  \n**Time:** 10:00 AM - 11:00 AM  \n**Location:** Conference Call (Internal IP Access)\n\n**Attendees:**\n1. **Jane Doe**  \n   - Email:.doe@company.com  \n2. **John Smith**  \n   - Email: john.smith@company.com  \n3. **Emily Johnson**  \n   - Email: emily.johnson@company.com  \n4. **Michael**  \n   - Email: michael.brown@company.com  \n\n**Agenda:**\n1. Project Alpha Progress Review  \n2. Discussion on Upcoming Milestones  \n3. Budget Revisions  \n4. Q Session\n\n**Notes:**\n\n**Progress Review:**\n- Jane highlighted that the current phase is on track, with significant milestones met on time.\n- John mentioned a few minor issues related to the data processing team which are being resolved.\n- Emily shared the latest test results, which are promising, but there are still bugs that need fixing.\n\n**Upcoming Milestones:**\n- John noted that Phase 2 will begin next week. Key tasks involve additional integration with third-party APIs.\n- Michael emphasized the importance of quality assurance before we advance beyond this point.\n\n**Budget Revisions:**\n- Emily brought up the revised budget allocations which show that the expenditure for the mid-term phase is well within our planned budget.\n- A new budget approval is necessary for any expenditures over $5,000, which raises concerns about additional API integration costs.\n\n**Key Issues Discussed:**\n- Jane and Michael discussed potential risks associated with server downtime and where to direct efforts for improved solutions.\n\n**Next Steps:**\n- Review and finalize the revised budget by the end of today.\n- John will coordinate with the data processing team to ensure all issues are resolved before Phase 2 commences.\n- Michael will follow up with the quality assurance team to confirm the bugs are fixed.\n- The next meeting is scheduled for November 5, 2023, at same time.\n\n**Dial-In Information:**\n- Conference Call Number: 1-867-5309\n- Access Point: 192.168.1.50 (Internal IP Address)\n\nThis concludes the meeting notes for Project Alpha Meeting on October 5, 2023. All attendees should review these notes and await further communication from their respective departments.\n\nBest regards,  \n[Your Name]  \n[Your Position]  \nDepartment Coordinator\n\n---\n\n**",
